  title: Mara's note
  words: Spark - I'm going for the sun mirror. A Harvester took its heart to the
    old station past the chasm. I'll bring it back. If I'm not back in ten days,
    don't follow me. Don't let anyone follow me. Keep the lights on. - Mara
